# MinIO Cache Credentials Template
# This file needs to be encrypted with agenix before use
# 
# To encrypt:
#   1. Install agenix: nix-shell -p agenix
#   2. Create this file with real credentials
#   3. Run: agenix -e minio-cache-credentials.age
#
# File format:
MINIO_ACCESS_KEY=your-access-key-here
MINIO_SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key-here
